<title>MOROCCO: Arafat arrives in Morocco to see King Hassan.</title>
<headline>Arafat arrives in Morocco to see King Hassan.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat arrived in Morocco on Thursday to brief King Hassan on the Middle East summit in Washington termed a failure by advisers to Arafat's Palestinian Authority.</p>
<p>&quot;I can make no comment until I have seen King Hassan,&quot; said Arafat at the airport. The Palestinian leader was expected to meet the king late in the morning and then leave for Paris.</p>
</text>
